// 太虚写的门步共用的文本处理（只用于判定的辅助与 detail 显示）：字节串小工具、按字符（码点）截取、仿 Python repr 的显示、
// 字节序排序与十进制解析。不导入 bootstrap/。

const HEX: string = "0123456789abcdef";

// 反斜杠换成正斜杠（用例名与比较用；交给本机 API 前再经 nat）。
export function slashes(p: string): string {
    const b = bytesFromStr(p);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < bytesLen(b)) {
        if ((bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0) == 92) {
            bytesSet(b, i, 47);
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return bytesToStr(b) catch p;
}

export function tail(s: string, from: int): string {
    return bytesToStr(bytesSlice(bytesFromStr(s), from, len(s) - from)) catch "";
}

export function byteSub(s: string, from: int, n: int): string {
    return bytesToStr(bytesSlice(bytesFromStr(s), from, n)) catch "";
}

export function endsWith(s: string, suffix: string): bool {
    return len(s) >= len(suffix) && tail(s, len(s) - len(suffix)) == suffix;
}

// 按字节序排序（插入排序；用例几千个以内）。
export function sorted(xs: List<string>): List<string> {
    const out: List<string> = listNew();
    for (x in xs) {
        listPush(out, x);
        let k = listLen(out) - 1;
        while (k > 0 && strLess(x, listGet(out, k - 1) catch "")) {
            listSet(out, k, listGet(out, k - 1) catch "");
            k = k - 1;
        }
        listSet(out, k, x);
    }
    return out;
}

export function strLess(a: string, b: string): bool {
    let i = 0;
    while (i < len(a) && i < len(b)) {
        const x = byteAt(a, i) ?? 0;
        const y = byteAt(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (x != y) {
            return x < y;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return len(a) < len(b);
}

export function isSpace(c: int): bool {
    return c == 32 || c == 9 || c == 10 || c == 13 || c == 11 || c == 12;
}

// needle 在 s 里首次出现的字节位置，缺席 −1。
export function indexOf(s: string, needle: string): int {
    const n = len(needle);
    let i = 0;
    while (i + n <= len(s)) {
        let k = 0;
        while (k < n && (byteAt(s, i + k) ?? 0) == (byteAt(needle, k) ?? 0)) {
            k = k + 1;
        }
        if (k == n) {
            return i;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return -1;
}

export function contains(s: string, needle: string): bool {
    return indexOf(s, needle) >= 0;
}

// s 的前 n 个字符。
export function headChars(s: string, n: int): string {
    let count = 0;
    let i = 0;
    while (i < len(s)) {
        const c = byteAt(s, i) ?? 0;
        if ((c & 0xC0) != 0x80) {
            if (count == n) {
                return byteSub(s, 0, i);
            }
            count = count + 1;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return s;
}

// s 的末 n 个字符。
export function tailChars(s: string, n: int): string {
    let count = 0;
    let i = len(s) - 1;
    while (i >= 0) {
        const c = byteAt(s, i) ?? 0;
        if ((c & 0xC0) != 0x80) {
            count = count + 1;
            if (count == n) {
                return tail(s, i);
            }
        }
        i = i - 1;
    }
    return s;
}

export function strip(s: string): string {
    let i = 0;
    let n = len(s);
    while (i < n && isSpace(byteAt(s, i) ?? 0)) {
        i = i + 1;
    }
    while (n > i && isSpace(byteAt(s, n - 1) ?? 0)) {
        n = n - 1;
    }
    return byteSub(s, i, n - i);
}

export function hex2(c: int): string {
    return byteSub(HEX, c >> 4, 1) + byteSub(HEX, c & 15, 1);
}

// Python 的 repr(str)：单引号（串里有单引号而无双引号时用双引号），转义反斜杠、引号、\t \n \r 与其余控制字符。
export function reprStr(s: string): string {
    let q = 39;
    if (contains(s, "'") && !contains(s, "\"")) {
        q = 34;
    }
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    bytesPush(out, q);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < len(s)) {
        const c = byteAt(s, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 92 || c == q) {
            bytesPush(out, 92);
            bytesPush(out, c);
        } else if (c == 9) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\t"));
        } else if (c == 10) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\n"));
        } else if (c == 13) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\r"));
        } else if (c < 32 || c == 127) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\x" + hex2(c)));
        } else {
            bytesPush(out, c);
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    bytesPush(out, q);
    return bytesToStr(out) catch "''";
}

// Python 的 repr(bytes[:n])。
export function reprBytes(b: Bytes, n: int): string {
    let m = bytesLen(b);
    if (m > n) {
        m = n;
    }
    let q = 39;
    let hasSingle = false;
    let hasDouble = false;
    let i = 0;
    while (i < m) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 39) {
            hasSingle = true;
        }
        if (c == 34) {
            hasDouble = true;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    if (hasSingle && !hasDouble) {
        q = 34;
    }
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    bytesPush(out, 98);
    bytesPush(out, q);
    i = 0;
    while (i < m) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 92 || c == q) {
            bytesPush(out, 92);
            bytesPush(out, c);
        } else if (c == 9) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\t"));
        } else if (c == 10) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\n"));
        } else if (c == 13) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\r"));
        } else if (c < 32 || c >= 127) {
            bytesAppend(out, bytesFromStr("\\x" + hex2(c)));
        } else {
            bytesPush(out, c);
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    bytesPush(out, q);
    return bytesToStr(out) catch "b''";
}

export function padRight(s: string, w: int): string {
    let t = s;
    while (len(t) < w) {
        t = t + " ";
    }
    return t;
}

// 十进制整数（可带负号与首尾空白，同 Python 的 int()）。
export function digits(s: string): int {
    let i = 0;
    let n = len(s);
    while (i < n && isSpace(byteAt(s, i) ?? 0)) {
        i = i + 1;
    }
    while (n > i && isSpace(byteAt(s, n - 1) ?? 0)) {
        n = n - 1;
    }
    let neg = false;
    if (i < n && (byteAt(s, i) ?? 0) == 45) {
        neg = true;
        i = i + 1;
    }
    let v = 0;
    while (i < n) {
        const c = byteAt(s, i) ?? 0;
        if (c < 48 || c > 57) {
            return 0;
        }
        v = v * 10 + (c - 48);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    if (neg) {
        return 0 - v;
    }
    return v;
}

export function crlf(b: Bytes): Bytes {
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    const n = bytesLen(b);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < n) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 13 && i + 1 < n && (bytesGet(b, i + 1) ?? 0) == 10) {
            i = i + 1;
            continue;
        }
        bytesPush(out, c);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return out;
}
